"900BU",47.83, 1.00,"R",10.63,"Applicable in CA:"
"900MU",47.83,11.63,"R",67.37," For your protection, California law requires the following to appear on this form: Any person who knowingly presents"
"900MU",48.70, 1.00,"R",78.00,"false or fraudulent information to obtain or amend insurance coverage or to make a claim for the payment of a loss is guilty of a crime and"
"900MU",49.55, 1.00,"L", 0.00,"may be subject to fines and confinement in state prison."
"900BU",44.83, 1.00,"R",27.68,"Applicable in AL, AR, LA, MD, NM, RI and WV:"
"900MU",44.83,29.48,"R",49.52,"Any person who knowingly (or willfully)* presents a false or fraudulent claim for payment"
"900MU",45.70, 1.00,"R",78.00,"of a loss or benefit or knowingly (or willfully)* presents false information in an application for insurance is guilty of a crime and may be"
"900MU",46.55, 1.00,"L", 0.00,"subject to fines and confinement in prison. *Applies in MD Only."
"900BU",51.06, 1.00,"R",10.45,"Applicable in CO:"
"900MU",51.06,12.18,"R",66.32,"It is unlawful to knowingly provide false, incomplete, or misleading facts or information to an insurance company for the"
"900MU",51.93, 1.00,"R",77.50,"purpose of defrauding or attempting to defraud the company.  Penalties may include imprisonment, fines, denial of insurance and civil"
"900MU",52.78, 1.00,"R",77.50,"damages.  Any insurance company or agent of an insurance company who knowingly provides false, incomplete, or misleading facts or"
"900MU",53.63, 1.00,"R",77.50,"information to a policyholder or claimant for the purpose of defrauding or attempting to defraud the policyholder or claimant with regard to a"
"900MU",54.48, 1.00,"R",77.50,"settlement or award payable from insurance proceeds shall be reported to the Colorado Division of Insurance within the Department of"
"900MU",55.33, 1.00,"L", 0.00,"Regulatory Agencies."
"900BU",57.08, 1.00,"L", 0.00,"Applicable in DC:"
"900MU",57.08,12.05,"L", 0.00,"WARNING: It is a crime to provide false or misleading information to an insurer for the purpose of defrauding the insurer"
"900MU",57.95, 1.00,"L", 0.00,"or any other person. Penalties include imprisonment and/or fines. In addition, an insurer may deny insurance benefits if false information"
"900MU",58.80, 1.00,"L", 0.00,"materially related to a claim was provided by the applicant."
"900BU",60.51, 1.00,"R",14.97,"Applicable in FL and OK:"
"900MU",60.51,16.72,"R",62.28,"Any person who knowingly and with intent to injure, defraud, or deceive any insurer files a statement of claim or"
"900MU",61.38, 1.00,"L", 0.00,"an application containing any false, incomplete, or misleading information is guilty of a felony (of the third degree)*. *Applies in FL Only."

