"900BU",33.86, 1.00,"R",78.00,"Applicable in NY: Applicable to all claim forms for insurance and all applications for commercial insurance and accident and"
"900BU",34.76, 1.00,"R",10.53,"health insurance:"
"900MU",34.76,11.53,"R",67.47," Any person who knowingly and with intent to defraud any insurance company or other person files an application for"
"900MU",35.63, 1.00,"R",78.00,"insurance or statement of claim containing any materially false information, or conceals for the purpose of misleading, information"
"900MU",36.48, 1.00,"R",78.00,"concerning any fact material thereto, commits a fraudulent insurance act, which is a crime, and shall also be subject to a civil penalty not to"
"900MU",37.33, 1.00,"L", 0.00,"exceed five thousand dollars and the stated value of the claim for each such violation."
"900BU",39.06, 1.00,"R",53.88,"Applicable in NY: Applicable to all applications and claim forms for automobile insurance:"
"900MU",39.06,54.88,"R",24.12,"  Any person who knowingly and with intent"
"900MU",39.93, 1.00,"R",78.00,"to defraud any insurance company or other person files an application for commercial insurance or a statement of claim for any commercial"
"900MU",40.78, 1.00,"R",78.00,"or personal insurance benefits containing any materially false information, or conceals for the purpose of misleading, information concerning"
"900MU",41.63, 1.00,"R",78.00,"any fact material thereto, and any person who, in connection with such application or claim, knowingly makes or knowingly assists, abets,"
"900MU",42.48, 1.00,"R",78.00,"solicits or conspires with another to make a false report of the theft, destruction, damage or conversion of any motor vehicle to a law"
"900MU",43.33, 1.00,"R",78.00,"enforcement agency, the department of motor vehicles or an insurance company commits a fraudulent insurance act, which is a crime, and"
"900MU",44.18, 1.00,"R",78.00,"shall also be subject to a civil penalty not to exceed five thousand dollars and the value of the subject motor vehicle or stated claim for each"
"900MU",45.03, 1.00,"L", 0.00,"violation."
"900BU", 5.23, 1.00,"R",10.36,"Applicable in KS:"
"900MU", 5.23,12.14,"R",66.86,"Any person who, knowingly and with intent to defraud, presents, causes to be presented or prepares with knowledge or"
"900MU", 6.10, 1.00,"R",78.00,"belief that it will be presented to or by an insurer, purported insurer, broker or any agent thereof, any written, electronic, electronic impulse,"
"900MU", 6.95, 1.00,"R",78.00,"facsimile, magnetic, oral, or telephonic communication or statement as part of, or in support of, an application for the issuance of, or the"
"900MU", 7.80, 1.00,"R",78.00,"rating of an insurance policy for personal or commercial insurance, or a claim for payment or other benefit pursuant to an insurance policy"
"900MU", 8.65, 1.00,"R",78.00,"for commercial or personal insurance which such person knows to contain materially false information concerning any fact material thereto;"
"900MU", 9.50, 1.00,"L", 0.00,"or conceals, for the purpose of misleading, information concerning any fact material thereto commits a fraudulent insurance act."
"900BU",10.66, 1.00,"R",18.29,"Applicable in KY, OH and PA:"
"900MU",10.66,20.31,"R",58.69,"Any person who knowingly and with intent to defraud any insurance company or other person files an"
"900MU",11.53, 1.00,"R",78.00,"application for insurance or statement of claim containing any materially false information or conceals for the purpose of misleading,"
"900MU",12.38, 1.00,"R",78.00,"information concerning any fact material thereto commits a fraudulent insurance act, which is a crime and subjects such person to criminal"
"900MU",13.23, 1.00,"L", 0.00,"and civil penalties."
"900BU",14.46, 1.00,"R",20.28,"Applicable in ME, TN, VA and WA:"
"900MU",14.46,22.00,"R",57.00,"It is a crime to knowingly provide false, incomplete or misleading information to an insurance company"
"900MU",15.33, 1.00,"R",78.00,"for the purpose of defrauding the company.  Penalties (may)* include imprisonment, fines and denial of insurance benefits. *Applies in ME"
"900MU",16.18, 1.00,"L", 0.00,"Only."
"900BU",17.38, 1.00,"R",10.47,"Applicable in NJ:"
"900MU",17.38,12.49,"R",66.51,"Any person who includes any false or misleading information on an application for an insurance policy is subject to"
"900MU",18.25, 1.00,"L", 0.00,"criminal and civil penalties."
"900BU",20.01, 1.00,"R",10.98,"Applicable in OR:"
"900MU",20.01,13.23,"R",65.77,"Any person who knowingly and with intent to defraud or solicit another to defraud the insurer by submitting an"
"900MU",20.88, 1.00,"L", 0.00,"application containing a false statement as to any material fact may be violating state law."
"900BU",22.23, 1.00,"R",10.32,"Applicable in PR:"
"900MU",22.23,12.05,"R",66.95,"Any person who knowingly and with the intention of defrauding presents false information in an insurance application, or"
"900MU",23.10, 1.00,"R",78.00,"presents, helps, or causes the presentation of a fraudulent claim for the payment of a loss or any other benefit, or presents more than one"
"900MU",23.95, 1.00,"R",78.00,"claim for the same damage or loss, shall incur a felony and, upon conviction, shall be sanctioned for each violation by a fine of not less than"
"900MU",24.80, 1.00,"R",78.00,"five thousand dollars ($5,000) and not more than ten thousand dollars ($10,000), or a fixed term of imprisonment for three (3) years, or both"
"900MU",25.65, 1.00,"R",78.00,"penalties.  Should aggravating circumstances be present, the penalty thus established may be increased to a maximum of five (5) years, if"
"900MU",26.50, 1.00,"L", 0.00,"extenuating circumstances are present, it may be reduced to a minimum of two (2) years."
